Description:
    A fork of 'HonestDiD' by Rambachan and Roth, based on its version 0.2.8, for the placebo output of the 'fect' package. It implements the sensitivity analysis of Rambachan and Roth (2023) <doi:10.1093/restud/rdad018> for event-study coefficients that have no reference period. The coefficients are differenced from the last placebo period, and the inference of 'HonestDiD' then runs on the result. It backs fect_sens() in 'fect' and works with 'fect' runs that use at least two placebo periods ending at the last untreated period, including covariates, unbalanced panels and estimators such as interactive fixed effects and Gsynth.
